<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3 Johana</book>
  <para style="h">3 Johana</para>
  <para style="toc1">3 Johana</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Johana</para>
  <para style="mt">3 Johana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upa chuan duh tak, Gaia, thutaka ka hmangaih chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ṭhian duh tak, engkimah i hmuingîla, thlarau lam leh taksa lamah i dam leh i hrisêl theih nân ka ṭawngṭaisak ṭhîn che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Unaute an lo kal a, thutaka i rinawmzia leh thutaka i awm tlatzia min rawn hrilh a, ka lâwm êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka fate thutakah an awm tih ka hriat aliama lâwmna nasa zâwk rêng ka nei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭhian duh tak, hêng unaute hi, mikhual pawh ni se an chungah i lo ṭha êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kohhran hmaah pawh i ṭhatzia an sawi an sawi mai. An zin kawngah anni hi Pathian lâwm zâwnga i lo ṭanpui zêl theih chuan a ṭha hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hming avânga thawk chhuak an ni a, Jentail-te hnên aṭangin eng mah an dawng duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, thutak ṭana thawk ho kan nih kan hriat theih nân keini hian hêng mite hi kan ṭanpui tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kohhran hnênah khân lehkha ka ziak tawh a; nimahsela, Diotrefa, an zînga hotu ber nih thlahlel khân ka thu a pawisa lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka lo kal hun chuan a chêt dân, thil râpthlâk pui pui tia mi puh thute ka hrilh vek ang che u. Chu chu tâwk ti lovin amah ngeiin unaute a lâwm duh lo va, a lâwm duhte pawh a khap a, kohhran aṭangin a hnawt chhuak lehnghâl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ṭhian duh tak, a ṭha lo chu zir suh la, a ṭha chu zir zâwk rawh. Thil ṭha titu chu Pathiana chhuak a ni, thil ṭha lo titu chuan Pathian a la hmu ngai lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Demetria hi mi tinin an fak a, thutaka fak pawh a hlawh a ni; keini pawhin kan fak ve a, kan fakna chu a dik a ni tih i hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I hnênah thu tam tak sawi tûr ka nei a; mahse, lehkha leh lehkhatuia ziak ka duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmuh thuai che ka beisei a, inhmatawnin kan la inbe dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thlamuanna i hnênah awm rawh se. Kan ṭhiante hian chibai an bûk a che. Kan ṭhiante kha an hming lam ṭheuhvin chibai mi bûksak ang che.
  </para>
</usx>
